+def _dp_max_partition_count(count: int) -> int:
+    """All-reduce MAX of the local THD-CP partition count across the pure-DP group.
+
+    Issued once per ``forward_backward`` op by every rank at the same call
+    site (before any partition runs), so it cannot interleave with the
+    per-partition EP collectives it protects. Guards mirror ``_dp_reduce_sum``:
+    identity without a process group or on a single-rank DP group.
